  "body_html": "<h1>liftCoeff_inl</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem liftCoeff_inl (A : I → Fin (n+1) → 𝕜) (k : ZeroRows A) (i : I) : liftCoeff A (Sum.inl k) i = if k.val = i then 1 else 0</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>ZeroRows</li>\n<li>liftCoeff</li>\n</ul>",
